1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Sticky-rice soup in the mortar? Real - but no miracle.
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Ming builders mixed lime with cooked sticky rice.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
The rice makes the lime crystals finer and denser.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
So it resists water and barely cracks.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Double-tap if ancient chemistry amazes you.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
It sealed the joints of 600-year-old city walls.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,500
But its raw strength is only average.

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,500
Clever fix or overrated? You decide.
